   "time_html": "<span>1 h (once)</span>",
   "title": "Bake the baking soda",
   "uses_rows": [
    {
     "amount_html": "<span class=\"q\" data-k=\"mass\" data-u=\"g\" data-a=\"60\">60 g</span><span class=\"qalt\"> (about <span class=\"q\" data-k=\"vol\" data-u=\"tbsp\" data-a=\"4\" data-alt=\"1\">4 tbsp</span>)</span> — enough for 3 batches",
     "name_html": "Baking soda"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "body_html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Wearing gloves, stir until fully dissolved:<ul class=\"ing\"><li>baked baking soda <span class=\"amt\"><span class=\"q\" data-k=\"mass\" data-u=\"g\" data-a=\"12\">12 g</span><span class=\"qalt\"> (<span class=\"q\" data-k=\"vol\" data-u=\"tsp\" data-a=\"4\" data-alt=\"1\">4 tsp</span>)</span></span></li><li>warm water <span class=\"amt\"><span class=\"q\" data-k=\"vol\" data-u=\"ml\" data-a=\"100\">100 ml</span></span></li></ul></li><li>Then add:<ul class=\"ing\"><li>cold water <span class=\"amt\"><span class=\"q\" data-k=\"vol\" data-u=\"ml\" data-a=\"100\">100 ml</span></span></li></ul></li></ul>",
   "heat": null,
   "id": "step-2",
   "images": {
    "alt": "Make the alkaline water",
    "diagram": null,
    "diagram_title": "Diagram",
    "how": [
     {
      "caption": "Gloves on: stir the baked soda into the warm water until it fully dissolves.",
      "src": "illustrations/alkaline-ramen-noodles/2-how1.webp?v=b20f1961dd"
     }
    ],
    "illustration": null,
    "photo": null,
    "result": "illustrations/alkaline-ramen-noodles/2.webp?v=e91b48154e",
    "svg_fallback": null
   },
   "n": 2,
   "part": null,
   "part_id": null,
   "time": "~3 min",
   "time_html": "<span>~3 min</span>",
   "title": "Make the alkaline water",
   "uses_rows": []
  },
  {
   "body_html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Put in a large bowl:<ul class=\"ing\"><li>bread flour <span class=\"amt\"><span class=\"q\" data-k=\"mass\" data-u=\"g\" data-a=\"200\">200 g</span></span></li><li>all-purpose flour <span class=\"amt\"><span class=\"q\" data-k=\"mass\" data-u=\"g\" data-a=\"200\">200 g</span></span></li></ul></li><li>Pour in the alkaline water while stirring with chopsticks, then work it together with your hands.</li><li>It will look <b>too dry and crumbly</b> — that’s right; it comes together while kneading and resting.</li></ul>",
   "heat": null,
   "id": "step-3",
   "images": {
    "alt": "Mix the dough",
    "diagram": null,
    "diagram_title": "Diagram",
    "how": [
     {
      "caption": "Pour in the alkaline water while stirring with chopsticks, then work it with your hands.",
      "src": "illustrations/alkaline-ramen-noodles/3-how1.webp?v=5ed6106e22"
     }
    ],
    "illustration": null,
    "photo": null,
    "result": "illustrations/alkaline-ramen-noodles/3.webp?v=b79773d7ee",
    "svg_fallback": null
   },
   "n": 3,
   "part": null,
   "part_id": null,
   "time": "~2 min",
   "time_html": "<span>~2 min</span>",
   "title": "Mix the dough",
   "uses_rows": []
  },
  {
   "body_html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Knead for <b>5 minutes</b>, pressing hard with the heel of your hand — the dough is stiff.</li><li>Wrap it and rest <b>20 minutes</b>.</li><li>Knead another <b>5 minutes</b> until smooth, wrap again and rest <b>1 hour</b> (fridge is fine).</li></ul>",
   "heat": null,
   "id": "step-4",
   "images": {
    "alt": "Knead, rest, knead",
    "diagram": null,
    "diagram_title": "Diagram",
    "how": [
     {
      "caption": "Knead hard with the heel of your hand for 5 minutes — it's a stiff dough.",
      "src": "illustrations/alkaline-ramen-noodles/4-how1.webp?v=d79611965e"
     }
    ],
    "illustration": null,
    "photo": null,
    "result": "illustrations/alkaline-ramen-noodles/4.webp?v=53adde7539",
    "svg_fallback": null
   },
   "n": 4,
   "part": null,
   "part_id": null,
   "time": "~1 h 30 min",
   "time_html": "<span>~1 h 30 min</span>",
   "title": "Knead, rest, knead",
   "uses_rows": []
  },
  {
   "body_html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Cut the dough into 4 pieces and flatten each one with your palm.</li><li>Run each through the pasta machine on the <b>widest setting</b>, fold in half and run it again — 3–4 times until it’s smooth.</li><li>Then step down to the <b>third-thickest setting</b> (about <span class=\"q\" data-k=\"len\" data-u=\"mm\" data-a=\"1.5\" data-s=\"0\">1.5 mm</span>), dusting with starch so it doesn’t stick.</li></ul>",
   "heat": null,
   "id": "step-5",
   "images": {
    "alt": "Sheet it",
    "diagram": null,
    "diagram_title": "Diagram",
    "how": [
     {
      "caption": "Run each piece through the widest setting, fold it, and repeat 3–4 times.",
      "src": "illustrations/alkaline-ramen-noodles/5-how1.webp?v=08e9c5d9e3"
     },
     {
      "caption": "Then step down to the third-thickest setting, dusting with starch.",
      "src": "illustrations/alkaline-ramen-noodles/5-how2.webp?v=d87d90f88a"
     }
    ],
    "illustration": null,
    "photo": null,
    "result": "illustrations/alkaline-ramen-noodles/5.webp?v=5e17f60478",
    "svg_fallback": null
   },
   "n": 5,
   "part": null,
   "part_id": null,
   "time": "~10 min",
   "time_html": "<span>~10 min</span>",
   "title": "Sheet it",
   "uses_rows": [
    {
     "amount_html": "<span class=\"q\" data-k=\"vol\" data-u=\"tbsp\" data-a=\"2\" data-b=\"3\">2–3 tbsp</span>",
     "name_html": "Cornstarch or potato starch"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "body_html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Run the sheets through the <b>thin cutter</b>, pulling the noodles out from underneath rather than pushing them.</li><li>Toss with a little starch and shape into loose <b>nests of about <span class=\"q\" data-k=\"mass\" data-u=\"g\" data-a=\"130\" data-s=\"0\">130 g</span></b>.</li><li>Cook now, keep in a bag in the fridge 2–3 days, or freeze the nests and cook them from frozen.</li></ul>",
   "heat": null,
   "id": "step-6",
   "images": {
    "alt": "Cut and portion",
