    "svg_fallback": null
   },
   "n": 6,
   "part": null,
   "part_id": null,
   "time": "~10 min",
   "time_html": "<span>~10 min</span>",
   "title": "Cut and portion",
   "uses_rows": []
  },
  {
   "body_html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Boil in plenty of unsalted water for <b>1½–2 minutes</b> — taste one: springy and cooked through.</li><li>Lift out with a strainer, shake off the water well, and straight into the bowl.</li></ul>",
